  "name": "Swarming Tides",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/water/projectile-ice-faceted-blue.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>By 7th level, you and your swarm are perfectly coordinated. You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>When you take damage, you can use your reaction to give yourself resistance to that damage. You vanish into your swarm and then teleport to an unoccupied space that you can see within 30 feet of you. You can use this a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus per short or long rest.</li>\n<li>You learn the Giant's Hand creation (in swarm form). You can use it without expending a creation slot a number of times equal to 1 + your Wisdom modifier, regaining all uses at the end of a long rest.</li>\n</ul>",
